    "title": "Trailer snags power line, snaps pole in Hermiston",
    "text": "Trailer snags power line, snaps pole in Hermiston\nPublished 9:00 pm Wednesday, October 8, 2025\nHERMISTON — No injuries were reported on Tuesday, Oct. 7, 2025, when a trailer hauling an oversized load caught a power line, snapping the pole in Hermiston.\nUmatilla County Fire District No. 1 responded to the accident at 3:50 p.m. at the intersection of Sagebrush Road and East Punkin Center Road.\nUmatilla Electric Cooperative arrived to attend to the broken power line and keep the scene safe while the trailer was removed.\nAlso assisting at the scene were the Umatilla County Sheriff’s Office and the Hermiston Police Department.",
